theorem k215Const3521Stage1 (u t w c a b v: nat): $ k215PReach (k215PState k215PNum3524 (k215PVector u 0 w c a b t 0 v)) (k215PState k215PNum3527 (k215PVector u w 0 c a b t 0 v)) $ = '(k215PReach_intro (eqtr k215Loop3524Vector (k215PStateeq2 (k215PVectoreq2 add0))));

